# /settings' Model row: Enter opens the model surface -- fx an inline list
# under the row, xfx `/model`'s menu -- and Escape.
# fx's harness launches it with FX_SOUND=0; xfx is given the same start.
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 2
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.3
snap marked
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap enter
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap esc
